{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/shahrukhz-danube-properties-al-sufouh","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1355,"crm_id":"6859","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Shahrukhz","slug":"shahrukhz-danube-properties-al-sufouh","display_address":"Al Sufouh","building_type":["offices"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Danube Properties","price":2000000,"display_price":"2M","lattitude":25.108278093062,"longitude":55.179233610017,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Shahrukhz by Danube is a landmark 55-storey tower named after Bollywood megastar Shahrukh Khan, created to honour 33 years of excellence shared by both the star and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-danube-properties/\">Danube Properties</a>. Located on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/sheikh-zayed-road/\">Sheikh Zayed Road</a>, it introduces a new commercial destination with 488 offices and over 40 world-class amenities.</p><p>Shahrukhz at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-sufouh/\">Al Sufouh</a> offers high ROI potential through premium office concepts, lifestyle-rich amenities, and elevated corporate design. Blending iconic branding with future-ready workspaces, it creates a distinguished address for companies seeking visibility, efficiency, and long-term growth.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_c126a9f073.jpg","hash":"Feature_c126a9f073","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_b48a92a6dd.jpg","hash":"Banner_b48a92a6dd","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-provident